# Tool Matrix

| Tool | Strength | Core job | Main output |
|---|---|---|---|
| 01 | Foundation | Privacy cleanup, quote removal, context summary | `preprocessed.json` |
| 02 | Foundation | Target-message classification and candidate sampling | `classified.json`, `stats.json`, `candidates.json` |
| 03 | Foundation | Human verification of model labels | `labels.json` |
| 04 | Advanced | Calibrate model statistics and build a dataset | `final_dataset.json` |
| 05 | Advanced | Extract deeper facts with provenance | `deep_facts.json` |
| 05.5 | Advanced | Turn facts into interview context | interview context |
| 06 | Advanced | Capture first-person authoritative facts | confirmed interview records |
| 07 | Intensive | Convert trusted facts into short style-matched samples | synthetic SFT samples |
| 08 | Intensive | Review SFT training quality | reviewed + deleted + progress |
| 09 | Intensive | Review/split RAG records | RAG-ready records |
| 10 | Intensive | Final balanced selection | final balanced dataset |

## Recommended presets

### Basic purification
`01 → 02 → 03 → 04`

适合已有相对干净聊天集，只需要快速得到可训练数据。

### High-quality persona pipeline
`01 → 02 → 03 → 04 → 05 → 05.5 → 06 → 07 → 08 → 10`

适合想尽量保留人物语言风格，同时补充长期稳定事实的场景。

### RAG-focused pipeline
`01 → 05 → 05.5 → 06 → 09`

适合先构建高质量、可复用的人物事实知识库。

## Output principle

每一级都尽量保留“可回溯性”：

- 不直接覆盖原始数据。
- 审核删除尽量保存原因。
- 人工确认和第三方事实分开。
- 合成数据使用单独的 `is_synthetic` / source 信息标记。
